# Module boundaries

Allowed: `app → module-ui → lib`, `app → lib`, `module-api → lib`, `lib → lib`.

Forbidden: `app → module-api`, `module-ui → module-api`, `module-ui → module-ui`, `module-api → module-ui`, `module-api → module-api`, `lib → app|module-*`, any `modules/*/api/db/`.

```ts
// BAD
import { createApp } from '@namma-medmate/auth-api';
import { AuthWidget } from '../../inventory/ui/src/components/auth-widget.tsx';

// GOOD
import { createApiClient } from '@namma-medmate/api-client';
import { AuthWidget } from '@namma-medmate/auth-ui';
```

UI talks to APIs only through `@namma-medmate/api-client`. Cross-module UI uses `@namma-medmate/event-bus`. Persistence only via `@namma-medmate/db-services`.

Enforced by `@nx/enforce-module-boundaries` and `pnpm exec nx run boundaries:validate`.
